OL,3,CCharity opens first paediatric
OL,4,Coperating room in West Bank
OL,6,FA Scottish charity has opened its
OL,7,Ffirst paediatric operating theatres in
OL,8,Fthe Palestinian territory of the West
OL,9,FBank.
OL,11,FKids Operating Room cut the ribbon on
OL,12,Fthe facility at Al-Ahli Hospital in
OL,13,FHebron earlier this week.
OL,15,FUntil now, children going to the
OL,16,Fhospital have had to be treated in
OL,17,Fadult wards.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/7
