OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786843096
OL,3,CCharity opens first paediatric
OL,4,Coperating room in West Bank
OL,6,FMedics in the West Bank have said the
OL,7,Fhospital infrastructure is struggling
OL,8,Fto cope with a rising need for
OL,9,Fpaediatric surgery, as it faces
OL,10,Fpressure from conflict and restricted
OL,11,Fmovement.
OL,13,FKids Operating Room uses its hub in
OL,14,FDundee to assemble medical equipment
OL,15,Ffor paediatric facilities in countries
OL,16,Fexperiencing humanitarian crises.
OL,18,FIt said constructing the operating
OL,19,Froom in Hebron was one of its most
OL,20,Fchallenging projects to date,
OL,21,Finvolving 3,000 pieces of equipment.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
