OL,3,CCharity opens first paediatric
OL,4,Coperating room in West Bank
OL,6,FKids Operating Room recently installed
OL,7,Fsix theatres in Ukraine which can be
OL,8,Fpowered by solar energy, meaning they
OL,9,Fcan continue working during blackouts.
OL,11,FIt plans to open two further
OL,12,Fpaediatric operating rooms in
OL,13,FBethlehem and Jericho.
OL,15,FKids Operating Room co-founder Garreth
OL,16,FWood and Middle East regional director
OL,17,FTariq Shadid travelled to Hebron for
OL,18,Fthe opening.
OL,20,FMr Wood said: "Getting this operating
OL,21,Froom here has tested us enormously.
OL,26,@|D@OOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786843096
OL,3,CCharity opens first paediatric
OL,4,Coperating room in West Bank
OL,6,F"But children in the West Bank still
OL,7,Fget appendicitis. They're still born
OL,8,Fwith conditions that need surgery.
OL,9,FConflict doesn't change that ` it just
OL,10,Fmakes getting them the care they need
OL,11,Fmuch harder."
OL,13,FHe spoke of his pride in the team
OL,14,Fwhich constructed the facility,
OL,15,Fadding: "We've committed to an initial
OL,16,Fthree operating rooms across the West
OL,17,FBank, and we're going to deliver them.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@MO]wD@IOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786843096
OL,3,CCharity opens first paediatric
OL,4,Coperating room in West Bank
OL,6,F"This theatre isn't a temporary fix,
OL,7,Fit's permanent infrastructure that
OL,8,Fwill serve children in Hebron for
OL,9,Fdecades to come.
OL,11,F"Seeing it open, alongside our
OL,12,Fpartners at Al-Ahli Hospital, is a
OL,13,Fhuge moment for this project and it's
OL,14,Fonly the beginning.
OL,16,F"We now turn our attention to
OL,17,FBethlehem and Jericho, so every child
OL,18,Facross the West Bank has the same
OL,19,Faccess to safe surgical care."
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUxD@AOU{D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
