OL,3,CCharity opens first paediatric
OL,4,Coperating room in West Bank
OL,6,FDr Youssef Al-Takrouri, general
OL,7,Fdirector of Al-Ahli Hospital, said:
OL,8,F"There is a long waiting list for
OL,9,Fchildren who need these operations,
OL,10,Fand some have to wait a long time for
OL,11,Fsurgery.
OL,13,F"This new operating room will help us
OL,14,Freduce that waiting list.
OL,16,F"Until now, we have operated two days
OL,17,Fa week because we share an operating
OL,18,Froom with other surgical services.
OL,26,@pD@AOUuD@AOUxD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
