CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F302A1786843096
OL,3,CCharity opens first paediatric
OL,4,Coperating room in West Bank
OL,6,F"With a dedicated operating room, we
OL,7,Fwill be able to operate throughout the
OL,8,Fweek, specifically for children and
OL,9,Fpaediatric cardiac surgery."
